# Exclude test files and coverage from EAS builds
**/__tests__/**
**/*.test.*
**/*.spec.*
**/coverage/**
**/.expo/**
**/node_modules/**

# Exclude entire Android directory for iOS builds
**/android/**

# Exclude source files and development artifacts
**/desktop.ini
**/.DS_Store
**/.idea/**

# Exclude documentation and build guides
**/docs/**
**/*.md
!README.md

# Exclude font source files (keep only .ttf files)
**/fonts/Othmani/**
**/fonts/*.zip
**/*.sql
**/*.xlsx
**/*.xls
**/*.docx
**/*.doc

# Exclude SQLite database (app uses Quran.json instead)
**/*.sqlite
**/*.db

# Exclude scripts (not needed in build)
**/scripts/**

# Exclude other development files
**/eas-hooks/**
**/*.log
**/.vscode/**
**/.vs/**
**/Thumbs.db

